{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19548","headline":"寒云轻重色 · 张仲素","name":"寒云轻重色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佳期当可许，托思望云端。\n鳞影朝犹落，繁阴暮自寒。\n因风方嫋嫋，间石已漫漫。\n隐映看鸿度，霏微觉树攒。\n凝空多似黛，引素乍如纨。\n每向愁中览，含毫欲状难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张仲素","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19548.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19548","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}